## Connection to VLSI / EDA / STA

Week 1 built the foundation for RTL design and verification.

The most important connection to VLSI and EDA is the idea of register-to-register design:

```text
launch register -> combinational logic -> capture register
```

The combinational modules represent logic between registers.

The sequential modules represent registers and state elements.

This prepares for later topics such as:

* FSM
* FIFO
* RTL-to-GDS flow
